{"slug":"sql-self-join","wpId":482,"title":"MySQL Self Join","category":"sql","categories":["sql"],"tags":[],"date":"2019-03-31T08:33:09","modified":"2021-01-19T01:31:48","excerpt":"Self Join is designed to return rows with other rows within the same table. Table1 is joined with itself. We are joining employees to their managers. You must use ALIAS for the table to distinguish the difference.","url":"/sql/sql-self-join","contentHtml":"<div class=\"boldgrid-section\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12 col-sm-12\">\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"\">Self Join is designed to return rows with other rows within the same table. Table1 is joined with itself.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"language-plaintext\"><code class=\"language-plaintext\">SELECT column_name1,column_name2,...\r\nFROM table_name1 tab1, \r\nINNER JOIN table_name1 tab2 ON condition;</code></pre>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<p class=\"mod-reset\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-858\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1005\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/04/image-66.png\" width=\"1331\"/></p>\n</figure>\n<div class=\"boldgrid-section\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12 col-sm-12\">\n<p>We are joining employees to their managers. You must use ALIAS for the table to distinguish the difference.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<p class=\"mod-reset\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-862\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"532\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/04/image-69.png\" width=\"1572\"/></p>\n</figure>\n<div class=\"boldgrid-section\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12 col-sm-12\">\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","toc":[],"wordCount":48,"readingMinutes":1,"status":"published"}